</table>
</para>
<para>All benchmarks:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Use kChimeraCanonicalSeed = 42 for deterministic test data.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Run with Repetitions(kRepetitions) to capture variance.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Connection pooling enabled for realistic scenarios.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
